### 1. GET all rooms - Success (200 OK)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms

### 2. GET all rooms with filters (minCapacity + keyword) - Success (200 OK)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms?minCapacity=5&keyword=Seminar

### 3. GET room by ID - Success (200 OK)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/1

### 4. GET room by ID - Failure (404 Not Found)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/999

### 5. POST create room - Success (201 Created + Location header)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Meeting Room B",
  "capacity": 10
}

### 6. POST create room with invalid capacity (>20) - Failure (400 Bad Request)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Auditorium",
  "capacity": 50
}

### 7. POST create room with invalid capacity (<1) - Failure (400 Bad Request)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Closet",
  "capacity": 0
}

### 8. PUT update room - Success (200 OK)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Seminar A (Updated)",
  "capacity": 12
}

### 9. PUT update room with invalid capacity - Failure (400 Bad Request)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Seminar A",
  "capacity": 25
}

### 10. PUT update non-existing room - Failure (404 Not Found)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ghost Room",
  "capacity": 5
}

### 11. DELETE room - Success (204 No Content)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/2

### 12. DELETE non-existing room - Failure (404 Not Found)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/999